        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='21889' hidden-by-user='true' id='61' type-v2='text' w='22200' x='72867' y='73778'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>ABOUT DASHBOARD</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Mitron Bank is a legacy financial institution headquartered in Hyderabad. The bank wants to introduce a new line of credit cards to broaden its product offerings and strengthen its position in the financial market.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>This dashboard analyses a sample dataset of 4,000 customers across different cities, demographics, spending categories, payment modes and income-related metrics.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>The analysis is designed to help understand customer demographics, spending behaviour, income utilisation and portfolio characteristics. These insights can support better customer segmentation and help the bank tailor its credit-card offerings to customer needs and market trends.</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Key Dashboard Sections:</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Demographics</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Spend Analysis – I</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Spend Analysis – II</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Income Analysis</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>• Detailed View</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3333' id='67' type-v2='text' w='16933' x='35400' y='75556'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>DASHBOARD INFORMATION</run>
          </formatted-text>
